<title>HONG KONG: TABLE TENNIS-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TABLE TENNIS-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the round robin</p>
<p>group stage of the US$75,000 women's World Cup on Saturday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Deng Yaping (China) beat Bose Kaffo (Nigeria) 21-7 21-12</p>
<p>Chan Tan-lui (Hong Kong) beat Jie Schopp (Germany) 24-22 21-19</p>
<p>Deng beat Chan 21-4 21-9</p>
<p>Schopp beat Kaffo 21-6 21-2</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Chai Po-wa (Hong Kong) beat Shirley Zhou (Australia) 21-17 21-9</p>
<p>Geng Lijuan (Canada) beat Ni Xi Lian (Luxembourg) 11-21 22-20</p>
<p>21-17</p>
<p>Ni beat Chai 21-10 21-17</p>
<p>Geng beat Zhou 21-9 21-15</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>Marie Svensson (Sweden) beat Yang Ying (China) 15-21 21-18</p>
<p>22-20</p>
<p>Otilia Badescu (Romania) beat Nicole Struse (Germany) 21-18</p>
<p>21-9</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>Wang Chen (China) beat Yolanda Rodriguez (Cuba) 21-13 21-8</p>
<p>Park Hae-jung (South Korea) beat Jing Jun Hong (Singapore)</p>
<p>17-21 21-18 21-17</p>
<p>Note: final group matches on Sunday with top two qualifying</p>
<p>for knockout stage</p>
</text>
